            "title": "Example: Syntax",
            "id": 91813,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sözdizimi hatası içermemesi için kod bloğunu tamamla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"member = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" member \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Happy Birthday, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + member)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"member\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Happy Birthday, Jason\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>[</code>, ardından <code>]</code> ve sonra <code>print</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir listede üyelik kontrolü yap. Kullanıcı girdisi istemeden <code>Happy Birthday, Jason</code> göster.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"member = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" member \" /><text value=\"in\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Alexis&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jason&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Happy Birthday, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + member)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"member\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"for\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"input\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Happy Birthday, Jason\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>[</code>, ardından <code>]</code>, <code>print</code>, <code>(</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Error types",
            "id": 91806,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki kod neden bir <code>IndexError</code> hatasına yol açıyor?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"180\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores[\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 2, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    scores[5]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"IndexError: list index out of range\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dizin aralık dışında</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>scores</code> tanımsız</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>scores</code> bir sözlük değil</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dizin aralık dışında.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hangi ifade bir <code>IndexError</code> oluşturmadan son puan olan <code>180</code>'e erişir?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"180\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"scores[\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 2, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    scores[5]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"IndexError: list index out of range\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>scores[2]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>scores[3]</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>scores[180]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>scores[2]</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Symbols",
            "id": 91817,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hatayla sonuçlanmayacak bir ifade yaz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"team_a = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team_b = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" team_a &gt; team_b:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Team A won the game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"null\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Team A won the game\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>=</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>&gt;</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Yalnızca <code>team_a</code>, <code>team_b</code> değerinden yüksek puana sahipse <code>Team A won the game</code> yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"team_a = \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"team_b = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" team_a &gt; team_b:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Team A won the game&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"null\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Team A won the game\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>=</code>, ardından <code>=</code>, <code>&gt;</code> ve son olarak <code>print</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Error types",
            "id": 91812,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki kod ne tür bir hata oluşturur?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"maximum = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;50&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" &lt; maximum: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;OK&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") \" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 3, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    if &quot;50&quot; &lt; maximum:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"TypeError: &quot;&lt;&quot; not supported between instances of &quot;str&quot; and &quot;int&quot;\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>TypeError</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>SyntaxError</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>NameError</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>TypeError</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"50\"</code> yerine <code>50</code> yazarsan kodu çalıştırdığında ne olur?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"maximum = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;50&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" &lt; maximum: \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;OK&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") \" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 3, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    if &quot;50&quot; &lt; maximum:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"TypeError: &quot;&lt;&quot; not supported between instances of &quot;str&quot; and &quot;int&quot;\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Hiçbir şey yazdırmadan tamamlanır.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">OK yazdırır.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Yine TypeError oluşturur.</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">NameError oluşturur.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Hiçbir şey yazdırmadan tamamlanır.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Error types",
            "id": 91816,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki kodun neresinde <code>SyntaxError</code> belirlenecek?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"guests = \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"table_size = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tables_required = guests table_size\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(tables_required)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    tables_required = guests table_size\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"                             ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: invalid syntax\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>tables_required = guests table_size</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>guests = 24</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(tables_required)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>tables_required = guests table_size</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Üçüncü satırın yerine hangisi yazılırsa <code>SyntaxError</code> giderilir ve masa sayısı hesaplanır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"guests = \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"table_size = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"tables_required = guests table_size\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(tables_required)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    tables_required = guests table_size\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"                             ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: invalid syntax\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>tables_required = guests / table_size</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>tables_required = guests table_size</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>tables_required = guests + \"table_size\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>tables_required = guests / table_size</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: the `else` keyword",
            "id": 92548,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mesajı yalnızca hesaplama yapılabiliyorsa yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"people = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  share = total / people\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"pass\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Your share is \" /><text value=\"{str(share)}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" units.&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"raise\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"finally\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Your share is 0.5 units.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>pass</code>, ardından <code>else</code> ve son olarak <code>prin</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Toplamı kişiler arasında böl. Hata oluşturmadan başarısızlığı işle ve mesajı yalnızca başarıdan sonra yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"total = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"people = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  share = total / people\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"pass\" class=\"keyword\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"f&quot;Your share is \" /><text value=\"{str(share)}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" units.&quot;\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"raise\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"finally\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"*\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Your share is 0.5 units.\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>/</code>, ardından <code>pass</code>, <code>else</code> ve son olarak <code>print</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Raise an exception",
            "id": 91239,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Hata mesajını tanımladığımız yerde nasıl bir istisna oluşturabiliriz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">  Parantez içinde mesajı içeren bir dizeyle birlikte <code>raise Exception</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print()</code> ifadesini kullanma</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>except</code> anahtar kelimesiyle</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">  Parantez içinde mesajı içeren bir dizeyle birlikte <code>raise Exception</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir istisna mesajını, dizesini <code>raise Exception(...)</code> içine yerleştirerek tanımlarız.</p><p>Hangi satır <code>Invalid age</code> mesajıyla bir istisna oluşturur?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>raise Exception(\"Invalid age\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>print(\"Invalid age\")</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>except \"Invalid age\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>raise Exception(\"Invalid age\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Data validation",
            "id": 91909,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir girdi değeri programımız için uygun değilse ne tür bir hata fırlatabiliriz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>ValueError</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>NameError</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>SyntaxError</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>ValueError</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir program <code>-4</code> yaş değerini alıyor. Girdi mevcut ancak değeri uygun değil. Program hangi hatayı oluşturmalı?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Değer geçersiz olduğu için <code>ValueError</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Yaş değişkeninin bir değeri olmadığı için <code>NameError</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Girdi Python sözdizimini bozduğu için <code>SyntaxError</code>.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Değer geçersiz olduğu için <code>ValueError</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: the `else` keyword",
            "id": 92542,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki kod bloğu ne yazdırır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"trips = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" / \" /><text value=\"&quot;Berlin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"raise\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Calculation not possible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  trips += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(trips)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 7, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    raise ValueError(&quot;Calculation not possible&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ValueError: Calculation not possible\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>ValueError: Calculation not possible</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Berlin</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>ValueError: Calculation not possible</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aşağıdaki kod bloğu ne yazdırır?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"trips = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"try\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" / \" /><text value=\"&quot;Berlin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"except\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"raise\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ValueError(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Calculation not possible&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  trips += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(trips)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Traceback (most recent call last):\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"File &quot;script.py&quot;, line 7, in &lt;module&gt;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    raise ValueError(&quot;Calculation not possible&quot;)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"ValueError: Calculation not possible\" /></content></output></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>ValueError: Calculation not possible</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">1</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>Berlin</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">İstisna türü olmadan <code>Calculation not possible</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>ValueError: Calculation not possible</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
